[
  {
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 2.4,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Welcome back to Trail Sessions.",
    "char_start": 17,
    "char_end": 48,
    "unit_id": "t0000.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0000.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 2.46,
    "end": 9.54,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Today, we're talking about trail building, and with me is Rafael Vasconcelos, a trail builder from the Cascadia Alliance.",
    "char_start": 49,
    "char_end": 170,
    "unit_id": "t0000.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0000.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 9.6,
    "end": 12.24,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Rafael Vasconcelos, thank you for being here.",
    "char_start": 171,
    "char_end": 216,
    "unit_id": "t0000.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0000.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 12.24,
    "end": 13.32,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Thank you, Beatriz.",
    "char_start": 237,
    "char_end": 256,
    "unit_id": "t0001.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0001.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 13.38,
    "end": 18.12,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "My pleasure – building trails is something I've been thinking about a lot.",
    "char_start": 257,
    "char_end": 331,
    "unit_id": "t0001.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0001.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 18.12,
    "end": 20.52,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "This episode is sponsored by Strava.",
    "char_start": 349,
    "char_end": 385,
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0002.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 20.58,
    "end": 22.38,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Strava is the home of athletes.",
    "char_start": 386,
    "char_end": 417,
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0002.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 22.44,
    "end": 24.18,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Start at strava.com/podcast.",
    "char_start": 418,
    "char_end": 446,
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0002.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 210.0,
    "end": 211.92,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Tell me about how you made that decision.",
    "char_start": 447,
    "char_end": 488,
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0002.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 211.98,
    "end": 214.74,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "How does RockShox fit into this picture?",
    "char_start": 489,
    "char_end": 529,
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0002.s05"
  },
  {
    "start": 214.74,
    "end": 219.84,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Honestly, drainage is the design decision that has the biggest impact on any trail.",
    "char_start": 550,
    "char_end": 633,
    "unit_id": "t0003.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0003.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 219.9,
    "end": 222.9,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "We've seen this in teams that use the Cascadia Alliance.",
    "char_start": 634,
    "char_end": 690,
    "unit_id": "t0003.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0003.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 222.96,
    "end": 226.32,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "I've already seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 691,
    "char_end": 761,
    "unit_id": "t0003.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0003.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 226.32,
    "end": 228.24,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Tell me how you made the decision.",
    "char_start": 779,
    "char_end": 813,
    "unit_id": "t0004.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0004.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 228.3,
    "end": 231.3,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "What is the version of the question that really matters?",
    "char_start": 814,
    "char_end": 870,
    "unit_id": "t0004.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0004.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 231.3,
    "end": 237.0,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Yes, look – the most common mistake that new builders make is excavating with too steep a slope.",
    "char_start": 891,
    "char_end": 987,
    "unit_id": "t0005.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0005.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 237.06,
    "end": 241.38,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
    "char_start": 988,
    "char_end": 1054,
    "unit_id": "t0005.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0005.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 241.38,
    "end": 242.7,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
    "char_start": 1072,
    "char_end": 1105,
    "unit_id": "t0006.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0006.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 242.76,
    "end": 246.6,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Where do soil erosion and trail construction intersect?",
    "char_start": 1106,
    "char_end": 1161,
    "unit_id": "t0006.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0006.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 246.6,
    "end": 246.96,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Certainly.",
    "char_start": 1182,
    "char_end": 1192,
    "unit_id": "t0007.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0007.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 247.02,
    "end": 252.12,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Discussions about land management must take place before the first excavation.",
    "char_start": 1193,
    "char_end": 1271,
    "unit_id": "t0007.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0007.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 252.18,
    "end": 254.7,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "We've seen this in teams that use RockShox products.",
    "char_start": 1272,
    "char_end": 1324,
    "unit_id": "t0007.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0007.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 254.76,
    "end": 258.9,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "The context is important because it tells you what commitments you are making.",
    "char_start": 1325,
    "char_end": 1403,
    "unit_id": "t0007.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0007.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 258.9,
    "end": 260.4,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Tell me more about it.",
    "char_start": 1421,
    "char_end": 1443,
    "unit_id": "t0008.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0008.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 260.4,
    "end": 269.94,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "And when teams adopt Spoke & Wrench within that workflow, the commitment becomes evident. If you ignore that, you'll end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
    "char_start": 1464,
    "char_end": 1643,
    "unit_id": "t0009.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0009.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 269.94,
    "end": 271.86,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Tell me how you made the decision.",
    "char_start": 1661,
    "char_end": 1695,
    "unit_id": "t0010.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0010.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 271.92,
    "end": 275.76,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Where do soil erosion and trail construction intersect?",
    "char_start": 1696,
    "char_end": 1751,
    "unit_id": "t0010.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0010.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 275.76,
    "end": 276.12,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Certainly.",
    "char_start": 1772,
    "char_end": 1782,
    "unit_id": "t0011.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0011.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 276.18,
    "end": 279.36,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "The cuts in the benching areas on the slopes are not optional.",
    "char_start": 1783,
    "char_end": 1845,
    "unit_id": "t0011.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0011.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 279.42,
    "end": 282.72,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "The shortcut of the first day is the downfall of the third year.",
    "char_start": 1846,
    "char_end": 1910,
    "unit_id": "t0011.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0011.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 282.78,
    "end": 286.86,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone ignores.",
    "char_start": 1911,
    "char_end": 1980,
    "unit_id": "t0011.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0011.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 286.86,
    "end": 288.6,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "That's a useful perspective.",
    "char_start": 1998,
    "char_end": 2026,
    "unit_id": "t0012.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0012.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 288.66,
    "end": 291.66,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "What is the most important version of the question?",
    "char_start": 2027,
    "char_end": 2078,
    "unit_id": "t0012.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0012.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 291.66,
    "end": 295.86,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Yes, look – the structure of the team is more important than people realize.",
    "char_start": 2099,
    "char_end": 2175,
    "unit_id": "t0013.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0013.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 295.92,
    "end": 298.8,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "We've seen this in teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
    "char_start": 2176,
    "char_end": 2225,
    "unit_id": "t0013.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0013.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 298.86,
    "end": 302.22,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "I've already seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 2226,
    "char_end": 2296,
    "unit_id": "t0013.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0013.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 302.22,
    "end": 303.6,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "What is the nature of the failure?",
    "char_start": 2314,
    "char_end": 2348,
    "unit_id": "t0014.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0014.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 303.66,
    "end": 307.92,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "What is the structural aspect that most listeners are unable to access?",
    "char_start": 2349,
    "char_end": 2420,
    "unit_id": "t0014.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0014.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 307.92,
    "end": 310.98,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Let me give you the version that I truly believe in.",
    "char_start": 2441,
    "char_end": 2493,
    "unit_id": "t0015.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0015.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 311.04,
    "end": 315.9,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "I've changed my mind about machine-made trails compared to hand-made ones.",
    "char_start": 2494,
    "char_end": 2568,
    "unit_id": "t0015.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0015.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 315.96,
    "end": 319.32,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "I've already seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 2569,
    "char_end": 2639,
    "unit_id": "t0015.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0015.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 319.32,
    "end": 320.82,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Tell me more about it.",
    "char_start": 2657,
    "char_end": 2679,
    "unit_id": "t0016.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0016.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 320.82,
    "end": 330.48,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "And when teams adopt the Cascadia Alliance framework, that commitment becomes evident. If you ignore it, you'll end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
    "char_start": 2700,
    "char_end": 2874,
    "unit_id": "t0017.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0017.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 330.48,
    "end": 334.14,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "We'll be right back after a short commercial break.",
    "char_start": 2892,
    "char_end": 2943,
    "unit_id": "t0018.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0018.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 720.0,
    "end": 722.7,
    "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_02",
    "text": "Today's episode is brought to you by Stripe.",
    "char_start": 2956,
    "char_end": 3000,
    "unit_id": "t0019.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0019.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 722.76,
    "end": 728.16,
    "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_02",
    "text": "Stripe makes payments simple, whether you're running a marketplace or a subscription business.",
    "char_start": 3001,
    "char_end": 3095,
    "unit_id": "t0019.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0019.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 728.22,
    "end": 731.46,
    "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_02",
    "text": "Visit stripe.com/podcast for a free trial.",
    "char_start": 3096,
    "char_end": 3138,
    "unit_id": "t0019.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0019.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 840.0,
    "end": 841.92,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Welcome back to the program.",
    "char_start": 3156,
    "char_end": 3184,
    "unit_id": "t0020.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0020.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 841.98,
    "end": 843.36,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "What does the failure mode look like?",
    "char_start": 3185,
    "char_end": 3222,
    "unit_id": "t0020.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0020.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 843.42,
    "end": 847.26,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Where do soil erosion and trail construction intersect?",
    "char_start": 3223,
    "char_end": 3278,
    "unit_id": "t0020.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0020.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 847.26,
    "end": 848.46,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "That's how I see it.",
    "char_start": 3299,
    "char_end": 3319,
    "unit_id": "t0021.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0021.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 848.52,
    "end": 852.78,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Drainage is the design decision that has the biggest impact on any trail.",
    "char_start": 3320,
    "char_end": 3393,
    "unit_id": "t0021.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0021.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 852.84,
    "end": 855.3,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "We've seen this with teams that use Shimano products.",
    "char_start": 3394,
    "char_end": 3447,
    "unit_id": "t0021.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0021.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 855.36,
    "end": 859.5,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "If you ignore this, you'll end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
    "char_start": 3448,
    "char_end": 3537,
    "unit_id": "t0021.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0021.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 859.5,
    "end": 861.42,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Tell me how you made the decision.",
    "char_start": 3555,
    "char_end": 3589,
    "unit_id": "t0022.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0022.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 861.48,
    "end": 864.24,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "How does RockShox fit into this picture?",
    "char_start": 3590,
    "char_end": 3630,
    "unit_id": "t0022.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0022.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 864.24,
    "end": 869.94,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Yes, listen – the most common mistake that new builders make is excavating with too steep a slope.",
    "char_start": 3651,
    "char_end": 3749,
    "unit_id": "t0023.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0023.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 870.0,
    "end": 874.32,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
    "char_start": 3750,
    "char_end": 3816,
    "unit_id": "t0023.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0023.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 874.32,
    "end": 876.9,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "It challenges my conventional wisdom.",
    "char_start": 3834,
    "char_end": 3871,
    "unit_id": "t0024.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0024.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 876.96,
    "end": 880.92,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "What did you used to believe about this, and how has your perspective changed since then?",
    "char_start": 3872,
    "char_end": 3961,
    "unit_id": "t0024.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0024.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 880.92,
    "end": 883.98,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Let me give you the version that I truly believe in.",
    "char_start": 3982,
    "char_end": 4034,
    "unit_id": "t0025.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0025.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 884.04,
    "end": 889.14,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Discussions about land management need to happen before the first excavation.",
    "char_start": 4035,
    "char_end": 4112,
    "unit_id": "t0025.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0025.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 889.2,
    "end": 892.08,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "We've seen this in teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
    "char_start": 4113,
    "char_end": 4162,
    "unit_id": "t0025.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0025.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 892.14,
    "end": 895.5,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "I've already seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 4163,
    "char_end": 4233,
    "unit_id": "t0025.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0025.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 895.5,
    "end": 897.0,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "That makes sense.",
    "char_start": 4251,
    "char_end": 4268,
    "unit_id": "t0026.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0026.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 897.0,
    "end": 902.58,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Outside of the tools provided by the Cascadia Alliance, it is more difficult to detect the failure mode.",
    "char_start": 4289,
    "char_end": 4393,
    "unit_id": "t0027.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0027.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 902.64,
    "end": 906.72,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone ignores.",
    "char_start": 4394,
    "char_end": 4463,
    "unit_id": "t0027.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0027.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 906.72,
    "end": 909.12,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "What heuristic do you always come back to?",
    "char_start": 4481,
    "char_end": 4523,
    "unit_id": "t0028.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0028.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 909.18,
    "end": 912.18,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "What is the version of the question that really matters?",
    "char_start": 4524,
    "char_end": 4580,
    "unit_id": "t0028.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0028.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 912.18,
    "end": 916.44,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "In short: cuts in the banking (or berm) on slopes are not optional.",
    "char_start": 4601,
    "char_end": 4668,
    "unit_id": "t0029.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0029.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 916.5,
    "end": 919.8,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "The shortcut taken in the first year leads to a collapse in the third year.",
    "char_start": 4669,
    "char_end": 4744,
    "unit_id": "t0029.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0029.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 919.86,
    "end": 923.22,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "I have seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 4745,
    "char_end": 4809,
    "unit_id": "t0029.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0029.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 1320.0,
    "end": 1321.38,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "What is the failure mode?",
    "char_start": 4827,
    "char_end": 4852,
    "unit_id": "t0030.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0030.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1321.44,
    "end": 1324.92,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of trail construction?",
    "char_start": 4853,
    "char_end": 4914,
    "unit_id": "t0030.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0030.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 1324.92,
    "end": 1327.98,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Let me give you the version that I truly believe in.",
    "char_start": 4935,
    "char_end": 4987,
    "unit_id": "t0031.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0031.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1328.04,
    "end": 1331.52,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "The structure of the soil is more important than people realize.",
    "char_start": 4988,
    "char_end": 5052,
    "unit_id": "t0031.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0031.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 1331.58,
    "end": 1334.58,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "We've seen this in teams that use the Cascadia Alliance.",
    "char_start": 5053,
    "char_end": 5109,
    "unit_id": "t0031.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0031.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 1334.64,
    "end": 1338.0,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "I've already seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 5110,
    "char_end": 5180,
    "unit_id": "t0031.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0031.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 1338.0,
    "end": 1339.32,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
    "char_start": 5198,
    "char_end": 5231,
    "unit_id": "t0032.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0032.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1339.38,
    "end": 1342.08,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "How does Shimano fit into this picture?",
    "char_start": 5232,
    "char_end": 5271,
    "unit_id": "t0032.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0032.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 1342.08,
    "end": 1347.66,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Yes, look – I've changed my mind about machine-made trails compared to hand-made ones.",
    "char_start": 5292,
    "char_end": 5378,
    "unit_id": "t0033.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0033.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1347.72,
    "end": 1352.04,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
    "char_start": 5379,
    "char_end": 5445,
    "unit_id": "t0033.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0033.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 1352.04,
    "end": 1354.14,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Where does it stop working?",
    "char_start": 5463,
    "char_end": 5490,
    "unit_id": "t0034.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0034.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1354.14,
    "end": 1359.24,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Outside of the RockShox-level tools, it's more difficult to detect the failure.",
    "char_start": 5511,
    "char_end": 5590,
    "unit_id": "t0035.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0035.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1359.3,
    "end": 1363.62,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
    "char_start": 5591,
    "char_end": 5657,
    "unit_id": "t0035.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0035.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 1363.62,
    "end": 1368.24,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Let's change the subject – I want to dedicate the final section to the management of territory.",
    "char_start": 5675,
    "char_end": 5770,
    "unit_id": "t0036.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0036.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1368.24,
    "end": 1375.74,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "That's where the conversation gets interesting, because the issues surrounding land management permeate everything we've discussed.",
    "char_start": 5791,
    "char_end": 5922,
    "unit_id": "t0037.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0037.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1375.74,
    "end": 1377.06,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
    "char_start": 5940,
    "char_end": 5973,
    "unit_id": "t0038.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0038.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1377.12,
    "end": 1381.32,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "What is the opposing viewpoint that most listeners don't have access to?",
    "char_start": 5974,
    "char_end": 6046,
    "unit_id": "t0038.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0038.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 1381.32,
    "end": 1386.66,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "In essence, drainage is the design decision that has the biggest impact on any trail.",
    "char_start": 6067,
    "char_end": 6152,
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0039.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1386.72,
    "end": 1389.24,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "We've seen this with teams that use RockShox products.",
    "char_start": 6153,
    "char_end": 6207,
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0039.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 1389.3,
    "end": 1393.44,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "If you ignore this, you'll end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
    "char_start": 6208,
    "char_end": 6297,
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0039.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 1393.44,
    "end": 1394.82,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "What is the failure mode?",
    "char_start": 6315,
    "char_end": 6340,
    "unit_id": "t0040.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0040.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1394.88,
    "end": 1398.36,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of trail construction?",
    "char_start": 6341,
    "char_end": 6402,
    "unit_id": "t0040.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0040.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 1398.36,
    "end": 1404.18,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Honestly, the most common mistake that new builders make is excavating with too steep a slope.",
    "char_start": 6423,
    "char_end": 6517,
    "unit_id": "t0041.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0041.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1404.24,
    "end": 1408.38,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "The context is important because it tells you what commitments you are making.",
    "char_start": 6518,
    "char_end": 6596,
    "unit_id": "t0041.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0041.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 1680.0,
    "end": 1685.16,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Before we finish, what's one thing listeners can try out this week?",
    "char_start": 6614,
    "char_end": 6681,
    "unit_id": "t0042.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0042.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1685.16,
    "end": 1689.24,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Choose one of the ideas we discussed and apply it for two weeks.",
    "char_start": 6702,
    "char_end": 6766,
    "unit_id": "t0043.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0043.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1689.3,
    "end": 1690.44,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Everything else is iteration.",
    "char_start": 6767,
    "char_end": 6796,
    "unit_id": "t0043.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0043.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 1690.44,
    "end": 1694.46,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "And to finish, a big thank you to our partners at Linear.",
    "char_start": 6814,
    "char_end": 6871,
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0044.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1694.52,
    "end": 1699.38,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Linear is the issue tracker designed for speed – built for the keyboard.",
    "char_start": 6872,
    "char_end": 6944,
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0044.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 1699.44,
    "end": 1700.76,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Check it out at linear.com.",
    "char_start": 6945,
    "char_end": 6972,
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0044.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 1700.76,
    "end": 1703.34,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "Rafael Vasconcelos, thank you for the conversation.",
    "char_start": 6973,
    "char_end": 7024,
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0044.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 1703.34,
    "end": 1704.84,
    "speaker_label": "Rafael Vasconcelos",
    "text": "Thank you, Beatriz.",
    "char_start": 7045,
    "char_end": 7064,
    "unit_id": "t0045.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0045.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1704.84,
    "end": 1707.06,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "That's all for today on \"Trail Sessions.\"",
    "char_start": 7082,
    "char_end": 7123,
    "unit_id": "t0046.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0046.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 1707.12,
    "end": 1707.96,
    "speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
    "text": "See you next time.",
    "char_start": 7124,
    "char_end": 7142,
    "unit_id": "t0046.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0046.s02"
  }
]
